# Place menu selection brackets (feat_town_brackets.py): from state 'town' (inn lobby, made by view_town on the
# same ROM) walk out to the Port Searis menu (Inn 1F preselected, tab 1 row 0), then Down through the rows and
# round, Right and Left through the tabs, Up, touch tab 0 (nothing selected: no brackets), touch its third row,
# then A (confirm and leave). Shots after each step.
load town
press Down 60
wait 150
watch u16 0x020B8C5C sel
watch u16 0x020B8C5E tab
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
shot tb_0
press Down 3
wait 25
shot tb_down1
press Down 3
wait 25
shot tb_down2
press Down 3
wait 25
shot tb_down3
press Down 3
wait 25
shot tb_wrap
press Right 3
wait 25
shot tb_right
press Left 3
wait 25
press Left 3
wait 25
shot tb_left2
press Up 3
wait 25
shot tb_up
touch 44 16 5
wait 30
shot tb_tab0
touch 128 105 5
wait 30
shot tb_touch_row
press A 3
wait 12
shot tb_confirm
wait 150
shot tb_after
# After the menu: the field menu still draws its own sheet and brackets (X, Right to System, A).
press X 3
wait 90
press Right 3
wait 30
press Right 3
wait 30
press Right 3
wait 30
press Right 3
wait 30
press A 3
wait 60
shot tb_field_system
